+/** @file
+ * Wireshark CBOR item encoding API.
+ * References:
+ *     RFC 8949: https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc8949
+ *
+ * Copyright 2017, Malisa Vucinic <malishav@gmail.com>
+ * Copyright 2019-2025, Brian Sipos <brian.sipos@gmail.com>
+ *
